# Case of the Ransacked Lab: on turn 3 Bot1 casts two Mutagenic Growths and Quick Study (three instants, paid exactly with Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet because the Case makes it cost {1}{U}, CR 601.2f)
# while Bot2 answers with its own Mutagenic Growth - four instants cast this turn in all, but only Bot1's three count as "you've cast" (CR 719.3a), so at Bot1's end step the Case stays
# unsolved, and the unsolved Case draws nothing for the casts (only Quick Study's own two cards come to Bot1's hand).

